# User Story: SRUM-101 - AutomationExercise Checkout Process

## Story Title
As a customer, I want to complete my purchase through the AutomationExercise checkout process so that I can order products online.

## Story Description
Implement and validate a complete checkout flow on AutomationExercise that allows customers to register or log in, add products to cart, review cart details, proceed to checkout, verify address and order details, enter payment information, place an order, download the invoice, and confirm order completion.

